      "transcript": "So what happened? Camille was in an accident on her way back home. I know, but what have the doctors said? I came as fast as I could. This is a matter of life and death, Tyler. The doctors came out an hour ago and asked for our consent. Consent for what, Dylan? They needed to shove the leg in order to save her. You're kidding, right? I'm not. If they hadn't done that, she would be dead now. Oh my god, I told her not to attend that meeting. If she had not gone, she would be fine at home. What meeting did she attend? The one for signing the petitions? I thought that it was dead in the water. It is, but you know how she is when she feels she's fighting for right cause? I should have been there, Dylan, to stop her from going. Oh no, Tyler. Stop it. We cannot be sure if that would have made any difference. We know her. Stop blaming yourself. The doctor is coming. Let's see what news he brings.",
