      "transcript": "Oh my god, I just need this semester to finish. Come on, easy. It has not been that dreadful, Daniel. Not at all, Marcus. How about the history assignment? What if the Nazis had won the world? Well, I think it is a pretty interesting matter. Imagine the scenario. If they had won, we all would be slaves, probably. Or worse, we would be dead. If they had won, we would not even exist, so why bother wondering? I think history is not a matter of dead in water. We are supposed to analyze the facts so we are not doomed to repeat them. I guess there's a point there. If we had not been born in a free country or world, we would not even have a bucket list to pursue. Definitely. I guess even when it seems the world crumbles down in some places, we are still pretty lucky to live the way we do. Indeed.",
