      "transcript": "So, what's new in the office, Dom? Not much, Dean. Well, Janice got gelled at by the boss. I mean, she made a mistake, but it was not okay. He gelled at her. No way. What happened? She forgot to reply to a message to a client confirming a launch meeting, but at the end it all worked out. So, okay, call her attention, but not yelling. If she got some nerve, she would have said something to him. I mean, not to defend herself, but to call for some respect. Maybe, if our boss weren't so feisty, she would have come up with something, but you know how he is. I know. She needs a shot in the arm just to finally make him understand that he must not yell at anyone to correct them. Indeed.",
