      "transcript": "Dave, did everyone send their documents? Not everyone, but all of them are here. How is that possible? Well, someone gave some other people a free ride. Marcus again? Oh my. If he weren't given people free rides, people would have been more responsible this time. I said the same thing. Nevertheless, he stated that the main issue was to have all documents on time and sent. So what else can we do? Nothing. I mean, he's a great guy always tensing his arm. What really annoys me is people taking advantage of him. Don't even mention it. I'm sure that if they weren't having a good cover for the end of the month, the boss would have sent some of them home already. I know. One can only hope.",
